  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      213.61,
      384.07,
      236.68
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE INLAND TRUSTRECEIPTS ACT, NO. 14 OF 1990",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      246.73,
      402.13,
      271.72
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      282.49,
      401.9,
      307.48
    ],
    "text": "1. (1)This Act may be cited as the Inland Trust Receipts(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      318.49,
      402.1,
      371.08
    ],
    "text": "(2)The provisions of this Act, other than the provisionsof this section, shall come into operation on such date as theMinister may appoint by Order published in the Gazette (inthis Act referred to as the \u201cappointed date\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      382.09,
      402.13,
      420.76
    ],
    "text": "(3)The provisions of this section shall come intooperation on the date on which the Bill becomes an Act ofParliament.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      431.77,
      402.13,
      512.2
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 3 of the Inland Trust Receipts Act, No. 14 of1990 is hereby amended in subsection (1) of that section, bythe substitution for the words \u201cregistered under theRegistration of Documents Ordinance as a bill of sale\u201d, of thewords and figures \u201cregistered under the Secured TransactionsAct, No. of 2023 as a bill of sale\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      522.97,
      402.14,
      631.48
    ],
    "text": "3. (1)Where on the appointed date an inland trust receiptwhich has been registered under the Registration ofDocuments Ordinance (Chapter 117) as a bill of sale is inforce, such inland trust receipt shall, for a period of two yearsfrom the appointed date, continue to be enforceable, but shallbe required to be registered under the relevant provisions ofthe Secured Transactions Act, No. of 2023 as a bill of sale,prior to the expiration of such period of two years.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      408.81,
      524.51,
      451.54,
      619.77
    ],
    "text": "Provisionsrelating toinland trustreceiptsregisteredunder theRegistrationofDocumentsOrdinance",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
